    "RouterConfig": {
      "kind": "udt_struct_v0",
      "spec": {
        "doc": "The address book the router calls into. Without it, every entrypoint would have to take the downstream contract addresses from the caller, letting anyone point the router at a hostile \"resolver\". With it, the router is stateless apart from this one instance value.",
